 "title": "Fog Fills Branching Valleys",
 "cat": "geography",
 "emoji": "🌫️",
 "sentences": [
  "White fog fills valleys like a branching river.",
  "On November 8, 2026, low clouds traced the Appalachian Plateau and Cumberland River.",
  "This fog forms because cold, dense air pools in valleys overnight.",
  "Rivers and streams add moisture, making the effect even stronger.",
  "By afternoon, these clouds dissipate, exposing the rivers and lakes beneath.",
  "Satellite sensors captured this dramatic change from morning to afternoon."
